  "source_pdf": "downloads/wukongs-little-dinosaur-halloween-v1.pdf",
  "source_sha256": "eb4940e8e69edc1601eb318bb0203e71698c12975fecf1fd886ab9301e2f9e39",
  "pixel_width": 1224,
  "pages": [
    {
      "image": "page-01.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "a75147da5d645da870bf715609a8243bd4c1e1fadcfd75399d51d120404cae70",
      "text": "Wukong’s Little\nDinosaur Halloween",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-02.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "f97c9712f0316e03a136775982ea62cc9b1f82b13684427cecd522a12f0544d3",
      "text": "It is Halloween night.\nWukong puts on his costume.\nGreen spikes,\na long green tail…\n“I am a dinosaur!”\n2",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-03.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "945037c1a89d6558a317d4a0eb3efa0e92c1325c200f6979e6c613dafd70576f",
      "text": "He practices in the mirror.\n“ROAR!”\nPigsy covers his ears\nand laughs.\n3",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-04.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "d890d71465e99c48d93f2276185629d7d56885890f6cf77c8f6e9cc7f95f0bc6",
      "text": "Rabbit flaps her bat wings.\nSandy holds a lantern.\n“Ready?” “Ready!”\n4",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-05.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "8a8716310ba7a49e0dfc7b78c78c3ef8b23e161390a497e29886d81057e5711b",
      "text": "The street glows orange.\nPumpkin lanterns smile\non every step.\n5",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-06.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "28046d80638d9c5af33674228601301e56d2834fdd5ae1f63fd68415a685a3c1",
      "text": "Ding-dong!\nWukong rings the first bell.\nWho will open the door?\n6",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-07.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "d0b251143b4fce96c2b67f7c919d463fd197bc3b1f8c747528b2ffb4317e2d29",
      "text": "“ROAR!” says Wukong.\nA tiny hedgehog\nhides behind her grandpa.\n7",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-08.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "4e994500e7358dd71cabba0a8efa81ef9da645a7eed2e843f231292b84704924",
      "text": "Wukong stops.\nThe little one is scared.\nHe crouches down low.\n8",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-09.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "0c7bb0c1170a90b5e1883ad1b05955617f1726d3b654d6e1ec429e0e8cf17ced",
      "text": "“rawr…” he says, very softly.\n“Trick or treat!”\nHe waves his little claws.\n9",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-10.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "9ccb26d7cdb765df7e7078aa701a004b9cb7fc91204642b19e3d4da1daab1ca7",
      "text": "The hedgehog\nis not scared now.\nShe giggles and puts\none candy in each pail.\n“Thank you!” say the friends.\n10",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-11.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "d946988473dbaeb148b66299e76a7745012e7205988f699196e72bfad6ee3ae7",
      "text": "Next is Tang Monk’s house.\nRing the bell.\n“Trick or treat!”\nTake one. “Thank you!”\n11",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-12.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "c0c02a130f7113ad03a699692c7d3ab4e63b61260afafe0697b34435b2c22e98",
      "text": "At the moon-gate house,\nChang’e holds a big bowl.\nPigsy looks at all the candy.\nHe takes just one.\n12",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-13.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "1e26d624679e6b63d4e2521c0a3caa370fa0a65a0c5851074519c924ff0a3a49",
      "text": "Sandy’s lantern flickers.\nHe smiles and pulls out\na spare battery.\n“I brought one, just in case.”\n13",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-14.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "f6d659283420fea55617500bc74c46abdda5d473429c55d76b7280b50d01a51f",
      "text": "At home, Wukong\npours out his candy.\nOne, two, three!\nHe gives one to Sandy.\n14",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-15.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "62744b6d01cc9e9b0a326df03ffc403dc61aa71244c44f786b651dff3fdb8262",
      "text": "“For me?” asks Sandy.\n“You walked with us!”\nsays Wukong.\n15",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-16.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "1b79b3524bb37cf25353f4d3b8c0ed25b1b84835837fd8c875019f483b1fcea9",
      "text": "Wukong yawns a big yawn.\nHis costume hood slips down.\n“rawr,” he says softly.\n16",
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "image": "page-17.webp",
      "width": 1224,
      "height": 1584,
      "sha256": "d22637ab6fc3dba430ef0766620f48df979b60ce1dd6eb422e5d1b92cb88016b",
      "text": "Wukong & Friends\nThank you for reading!\nWe hope you and your little reader\nenjoyed this little adventure.\nMore free stories\nphg1024.github.io/wukong-and-friends\nRead, download and print - always free.\nRead more free stories\nIf you enjoyed our stories, you are welcome\nto help the next one grow. Support is optional.\nBuy Me a Coffee\nGitHub Sponsors\nCreated by Peihong Guo\nStories and illustrations made with AI assistance and human editing.\n© 2026 Peihong Guo\nCC BY-NC-ND 4.0 · Attribution · NonCommercial · NoDerivatives\ncreativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-nd/4.0/",
